  "scope": "Expose validated per-vault recovery history and a configurable age/size retention plan in the native egui shell.",
  "behavior": [
    "The user can request a history refresh; metadata enumeration and retention planning run on a Rayon worker and return over an mpsc channel.",
    "The UI lists recovery, failed-write and unresolved-conflict records with relative path, size, approximate age and protected status.",
    "The user can set a retention age from 1 to 3650 days and a size cap from 0.1 to 1024 GiB; changing either value invalidates the prior preview.",
    "This slice only reads history and plans retention. It does not delete records; unresolved conflicts remain protected."
  ],
